  "summary": "Mechanical Engineer turned Full Stack Developer with 14 years of professional experience. I am a recent graduate of Flatiron School's Software Development Program, seeking opportunities in Education Technology and Wellness. \n\nSkills: Ruby, Ruby on Rails, JavaScript, React/Redux, Python, R, SQL, AJAX, Git/GitHub, Project Management, Design, Root Cause Analysis\n\nStrengths: Cross-functional Team Leadership, Problem Solving, Object Oriented Programming, Process Improvement\n\nI have worked for the past 14 years in the Space industry in a wide range of engineering roles. I have worked on the launch pad for two flights, preparing documents that allowed us to fly and providing engineering oversight for launch operations, and have been in the control room for two others, responsible for the telemetry and communication with the vehicle during launch. During my tenure, I feel as if I have experienced all that I am interested in and am looking for new challenges.\n\nI would like to work more directly with customers and feel the direct impact my work has. I am interested in education and wellness, as I believe that these fields have some of the greatest disparities in the have and have-nots, and I would like to help fix this issue.\n\nContact: mntamaru@gmail.com ",
